const controlDefs=[['lock','锁车'],['fan','空调'],['trunk','后备箱'],['shield','哨兵'],['horn','鸣笛'],['bulb','闪灯'],['window','车窗'],['bolt','充电口']];
let selectedControls=['lock','fan','trunk','shield'];try{selectedControls=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('pony-preview-controls'))||selectedControls}catch{}
const quickControls=()=>controlDefs.filter(([id])=>selectedControls.includes(id)).map(([id,label])=>`<button data-action="control" data-control="${label}"><span class="control-icon ${id==='lock'?'active':''}">${icon(id)}</span>${label}</button>`).join('');
const vehicle=()=>`<div class="content">${topline('PONY / MODEL 3')}<header class="header vehicle-header"><div class="row"><h1 class="page-title">我的 Model 3</h1><button class="round-button" data-action="vehicle-info" aria-label="车辆信息">${icon('chevron')}</button></div><div class="subtle"><span class="online"></span>已锁车 · 停放中 <span style="float:right;font-size:9px">刚刚更新</span></div></header><div class="car-stage">${car()}<div class="vehicle-caption"><span>MODEL 3</span><span>2022 · 后轮驱动</span></div></div><div class="battery-stats"><div><div class="big-num">62<small>%</small><span class="battery-mini"></span></div><div class="subtle">当前电量</div></div><div class="range"><strong>276</strong> <span>km</span><div class="subtle">预计续航</div></div></div><div class="section-title"><h2>快捷控制</h2><button class="edit" data-action="edit">${icon('edit')} 编辑</button></div><div class="quick-controls">${quickControls()}</div><div class="card climate"><span class="tile-icon">${icon('fan')}</span><div class="text"><div class="card-label">空调</div><div class="card-sub">车内 24° · 车外 21°</div></div><div class="temperature">22<small>°C</small></div><button class="power" data-action="control" data-control="空调" aria-label="切换空调">${icon('power')}</button></div><button class="card location-card" data-action="location" style="width:100%;text-align:left">${map('home')}<div class="location-text"><div class="card-label">${icon('pin')} 车辆位置</div><div class="card-sub">湖滨路 · 地下停车场 B2</div></div><span class="location-arrow">${icon('arrow')}</span></button><button class="settings-entry" data-action="settings" style="width:100%">${icon('settings')} 车况与设置 <span class="right">胎压 · 电池 · 软件 ${icon('chevron')}</span></button></div>`;
const trips=()=>`<div class="content">${topline('YOUR JOURNEY')}<header class="header"><div class="row"><h1 class="page-title">行程</h1><span class="pill">${icon('clock')} 最近 7 天</span></div><p class="subtitle">每一次出发，都有迹可循。</p></header><div class="week">${['三','四','五','六','日','一','二'].map((d,i)=>`<button class="day ${i===6?'selected':''}" data-day="${i+7}"><span>${d}</span><strong>${i+7}</strong></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="trip-summary"><div class="summary-label">本周已行驶 <span>10.07 — 10.13</span></div><div class="distance">186.8<small>km</small></div><div class="summary-bottom"><div><strong>12</strong><small>段</small><p>累计行程</p></div><div><strong>25.6</strong><small>kWh</small><p>估算耗电</p></div><div><strong>137</strong><small>Wh/km</small><p>平均能耗</p></div></div></div><div class="section-title"><h2 id="trip-day-title">今天 <span class="light">10 月 13 日</span></h2><span class="light" id="trip-count">2 段行程</span></div><div id="trip-list"><button class="card trip-card" data-page="detail"><div class="trip-map">${map('trip')}<span class="map-overlay">${icon('route')} 日常通勤</span></div><div class="trip-body"><div class="trip-route">家 ${icon('arrow')} 公司</div><div class="subtle">08:12 — 08:44 · 电量 66% → 62%</div><div class="trip-metrics"><div><strong>18.6</strong><small>km</small><p>行驶里程</p></div><div><strong>32</strong><small>min</small><p>行驶时长</p></div><div><strong>132</strong><small>Wh/km</small><p>平均能耗 · 估算</p></div></div></div></button><button class="card trip-compact" data-action="second-trip"><span class="tiny-route">${icon('route')}</span><div><div class="card-label">公司 → 城市公园</div><div class="subtle">12:08 — 12:26 · 18 分钟</div></div><div class="distance-small">9.8 <small>km</small></div></button></div><div class="retention">${icon('cloud')} 行程存于云端，滚动保留 7 天</div></div>`;
const charging=()=>`<div class="content">${topline('ENERGY, RECHARGED')}<header class="header"><div class="row"><h1 class="page-title">充电</h1><span class="pill">${icon('plug')} 已连接</span></div><p class="subtitle">家用充电桩 · 交流充电</p></header><div class="charge-hero"><div class="charge-ring"><svg viewBox="0 0 230 230"><circle cx="115" cy="115" r="100" fill="none" stroke="#e6ecdb" stroke-width="1"/><circle class="charging-orbit" cx="115" cy="115" r="88" fill="#edf3e2"/><circle cx="115" cy="115" r="85" fill="none" stroke="#e0e8d1" stroke-width="5" stroke-dasharray="400 135" transform="rotate(135 115 115)" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="115" cy="115" r="85" fill="none" stroke="#648355" stroke-width="5" stroke-dasharray="305 230" transform="rotate(135 115 115)" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="193" cy="81" r="6" fill="#5c8050" stroke="#f5f7ed" stroke-width="3"/></svg><div class="ring-value">62<small>%</small></div><div class="charging-label">${icon('bolt')} 正在充电</div></div><div class="charge-eta">约 <strong id="charge-eta">1 小时 35 分</strong> 后充至 <strong id="charge-target">80%</strong></div></div><div class="card charge-stats"><div><strong>7.0</strong><small>kW</small><p>当前功率</p></div><div><strong>12.4</strong><small>kWh</small><p>本次充入</p></div><div><strong>1:47</strong><p>已充电时长</p></div></div><div class="card limit-card"><div class="row"><span>充电上限</span><strong id="limit-value">80%</strong></div><input aria-label="充电上限" id="charge-limit" type="range" min="50" max="100" value="80" step="5"><div class="limit-scale"><span>50%</span><span>日常使用</span><span>100%</span></div></div><div class="charge-actions"><button class="primary-button" data-action="control" data-control="暂停充电">${icon('pause')} 暂停充电</button><button class="secondary-button" data-action="schedule">${icon('clock')} 充电预约</button></div><div class="section-title"><h2>最近充电</h2><button class="edit" data-action="history">全部记录 ${icon('chevron')}</button></div><button class="card charge-record" data-action="history" style="width:100%;text-align:left"><span class="tile-icon">${icon('bolt')}</span><div><div class="card-label">家用充电桩</div><div class="card-sub">昨天 22:30 · 36% → 80%</div></div><div class="record-value">25.8 <small>kWh</small><p>3 小时 42 分</p></div></button><div class="retention">${icon('wave')} 记录每一次补能</div></div>`;
const menu=(i,label,value,action)=>`<button class="menu-row" data-action="${action}">${icon(i)}<span class="label">${label}</span>${value?`<span class="value">${value}</span>`:''}${icon('chevron','chevron')}</button>`;
const profile=()=>`<div class="content">${topline('MADE FOR YOUR DRIVE')}<header class="header"><h1 class="page-title">我的</h1></header><div class="profile"><div class="avatar">P</div><div><div class="name">Pony 车主</div><div class="account">Tesla 账号已连接 · 示例</div></div><button class="round-button" data-action="account" aria-label="账号设置">${icon('chevron')}</button></div><button class="my-car" data-action="vehicle-info" style="width:100%;text-align:left">${icon('car')}<div><div class="card-label">我的 Model 3</div><div class="card-sub">2022 · 后轮驱动</div></div><span class="pill">当前车辆</span></button><div class="group-label">车辆与账号</div><div class="card menu-group">${menu('key','账号与车辆授权','','account')}${menu('layout','首页快捷控制','4 个','edit')}${menu('doc','操作记录','','logs')}</div><div class="group-label">数据与隐私</div><div class="card menu-group">${menu('cloud','行程数据管理','保留 7 天','data')}${menu('export','导出我的数据','','export')}${menu('shield','隐私与权限','','privacy')}</div><div class="group-label">应用</div><div class="card menu-group">${menu('settings','偏好设置','','preferences')}${menu('help','帮助与反馈','','help')}</div><div class="profile-footer"><div class="brand-word">PONY</div><p>让每一程，更有数。</p></div></div>`;
const chart=(mode='speed')=>`<svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 309 116" preserveAspectRatio="none"><defs><linearGradient id="chartfill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#a7bd82" stop-opacity=".38"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#a7bd82" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M0 18H309M0 50H309M0 83H309" stroke="#edf0e6" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/><path d="M0 101 10 93 20 83 30 85 40 48 50 54 60 45 70 70 80 63 90 39 100 44 110 20 120 31 130 32 140 49 150 60 160 39 170 40 180 26 190 37 200 21 210 53 220 52 230 71 240 51 250 63 260 59 270 80 280 74 290 87 309 100V116H0Z" fill="url(#chartfill)"/><path d="M0 101 10 93 20 83 30 85 40 48 50 54 60 45 70 70 80 63 90 39 100 44 110 20 120 31 130 32 140 49 150 60 160 39 170 40 180 26 190 37 200 21 210 53 220 52 230 71 240 51 250 63 260 59 270 80 280 74 290 87 309 100" stroke="#638251" stroke-width="2.2" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M180 7V106" stroke="#9fac8b" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/><circle cx="180" cy="26" r="4" fill="#537442" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/><text x="307" y="14" text-anchor="end" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="8" fill="#9faa91">${mode==='power'?'60 kW':mode==='battery'?'66%':'80 km/h'}</text></svg>`;
const detail=()=>`<div class="content detail-content"><div class="detail-top"><button class="round-button" data-page="trips" aria-label="返回行程">${icon('back')}</button><strong>行程详情</strong><button class="round-button" data-action="export" aria-label="导出行程">${icon('export')}</button></div><div class="detail-map">${map('detail',true)}<span class="map-overlay">${icon('route')} 10 月 13 日 · 周二</span><button class="map-zoom" data-action="map" aria-label="查看轨迹">${icon('expand')}</button></div><div class="detail-heading"><span class="pill">日常通勤</span><h2>家 → 公司</h2><div class="subtle">08:12 — 08:44 · 示例行程</div></div><div class="detail-metrics"><div><strong>18.6</strong><small>km</small><p>行驶里程</p></div><div><strong>32</strong><small>min</small><p>行驶时长</p></div><div><strong>2.46</strong><small>kWh</small><p>估算耗电</p></div></div><div class="card chart-card"><div class="row"><div class="segmented"><button class="selected" data-chart="speed">速度</button><button data-chart="power">功率</button><button data-chart="battery">电量</button></div><div class="chart-value" id="chart-value">56<small>km/h</small></div></div><div id="chart-area">${chart()}</div><div class="chart-times"><span>08:12</span><span>08:28</span><span>08:44</span></div><div class="playback"><button class="play" data-action="play" aria-label="播放轨迹">${icon('play')}</button><input aria-label="回放进度" type="range" min="0" max="32" value="19" id="replay-progress"><span class="time" id="replay-time">08:31</span></div></div><div class="detail-note">拖动时间轴，联动查看位置与车况 · 示例数据</div></div>`;
const renderers={vehicle,trips,charging,profile,detail};
function phone(page){return `<section class="phone" data-screen="${page}">${statusbar()}${renderers[page]()}${nav(page==='detail'?'trips':page)}</section>`}
const root=document.getElementById('app');
const params=new URLSearchParams(location.search);
const board=params.get('view')==='board';
function render(page='vehicle'){
  if(board){root.className='board';root.innerHTML=`<header class="board-heading"><div><div class="board-brand">PONY / TESLA COMPANION</div><h1>让每一程，更有数。</h1></div><div class="board-meta">iOS 界面设计 · 第一版<br>2022 Model 3 / 概念原型 · 全部为示例数据</div></header><div class="board-grid">${tabs.map(([id,i,label],n)=>`<div class="board-frame">${phone(id)}<div class="screen-caption"><div class="number">0${n+1}</div><strong>${label}</strong><span>${['车辆概览与自定义控制','最近 7 天的路线与数据','充电状态与每次补能','授权、云端数据与偏好'][n]}</span></div></div>`).join('')}</div><footer class="board-footer"><span>暖白底色 / 墨绿强调 / 清晰的数据层级</span><span>UI PROTOTYPE · 尚未连接真实车辆</span></footer>`}
  else{root.className='screen-only';root.innerHTML=phone(renderers[page]?page:'vehicle')}
}
render(params.get('page')||'vehicle');
function toast(target,text){target.querySelector('.toast')?.remove();const el=document.createElement('div');el.className='toast';el.setAttribute('role','status');el.textContent=text;target.append(el);setTimeout(()=>el.remove(),3500)}
function sheet(target,title,body,extra=''){target.querySelector('.sheet-overlay')?.remove();const el=document.createElement('div');el.className='sheet-overlay';el.innerHTML=`<section class="sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="${title}"><div class="sheet-handle"></div><h2>${title}</h2><p>${body}</p>${extra}<button class="primary-button" data-action="close-sheet">完成</button></section>`;target.append(el);el.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===el)el.remove()})}
const messages={account:['账号与车辆授权','正式版会通过 Tesla 官方登录授权。此处展示的是示例账号，尚未接入真实车辆。'],data:['你的数据，由你掌握','行程、轨迹和曲线保存在服务器，滚动保留最近 7 天。到期记录自动清理，也可以提前导出或删除。'],privacy:['隐私与权限','按需授权车辆与位置数据。账号登录在 Tesla 官方页面完成，Pony 不收集你的 Tesla 密码。'],settings:['车况与设置','根据车辆能力提供以下入口。此原型展示布局，暂不执行车辆操作。'],location:['找到你的车','正式版可查看车辆位置、搜索地点并发送到车机。此处的道路和停车位置均为示意。'],schedule:['充电预约','可设置开始充电时间与完成时间。当前为界面预览，不会下发车辆预约。'],history:['充电记录','展示每次充电的时间、电量变化、充入电量和功率曲线，不包含费用统计。'],logs:['操作记录','这里记录通过 Pony 发出的操作及车辆反馈，区分执行中、成功和失败。'],preferences:['偏好设置','第一版保留必要的单位、通知与显示设置，后续再丰富自定义功能。'],help:['帮助与反馈','这是 Pony 的第一版界面原型，主要用来确认功能布局与视觉风格。'], 'vehicle-info':['我的 Model 3','2022 款 Model 3 · 旧款车身造型。车型、电量与状态用于界面演示，以接入后的实际车辆数据为准。'],map:['行程轨迹','正式版地图与下方速度、功率、电量曲线共用时间轴。当前路线为手绘示意。'],'second-trip':['公司 → 城市公园','12:08 — 12:26 · 9.8 km · 示例数据。此行程用于展示列表中的第二段记录。']};
root.addEventListener('click',e=>{
  const btn=e.target.closest('button');if(!btn)return;const target=btn.closest('.phone');
  if(btn.dataset.page){if(board){const container=target;container.outerHTML=phone(btn.dataset.page)}else{history.replaceState(null,'',`?page=${btn.dataset.page}`);render(btn.dataset.page)}return}
  if(btn.dataset.day){target.querySelectorAll('[data-day]').forEach(el=>el.classList.toggle('selected',el===btn));target.querySelector('#trip-day-title').innerHTML=`${btn.dataset.day==='13'?'今天':'示例日期'} <span class="light">10 月 ${btn.dataset.day} 日</span>`;target.querySelector('#trip-count').textContent=btn.dataset.day==='13'?'2 段行程':'暂无示例记录';target.querySelector('#trip-list').hidden=btn.dataset.day!=='13';return}
  if(btn.dataset.chart){target.querySelectorAll('[data-chart]').forEach(el=>el.classList.toggle('selected',el===btn));const mode=btn.dataset.chart;target.querySelector('#chart-area').innerHTML=chart(mode);target.querySelector('#chart-value').innerHTML=mode==='speed'?'56<small>km/h</small>':mode==='power'?'18<small>kW</small>':'64<small>%</small>';toast(target,'曲线布局预览：当前曲线为示意，尚未接入遥测。');return}
  const action=btn.dataset.action;
  if(action==='control'){sheet(target,btn.dataset.control,`原型操作预览：${btn.dataset.control}。正式版会在必要时二次确认，并等待车辆返回执行结果。当前未向任何车辆发送指令。`);return}
  if(action==='edit'){sheet(target,'编辑快捷控制','选择想放在首页的功能，最多 4 项。此处仅保存原型的显示偏好。',`<div class="sheet-options">${controlDefs.map(([id,label])=>`<button class="sheet-option ${selectedControls.includes(id)?'selected':''}" data-choice="${id}">${icon(id)}${label}</button>`).join('')}</div>`);return}
  if(btn.dataset.choice){const id=btn.dataset.choice;if(selectedControls.includes(id))selectedControls=selectedControls.filter(x=>x!==id);else if(selectedControls.length<4)selectedControls.push(id);else{toast(target,'首页最多显示 4 个快捷控制。');return}btn.classList.toggle('selected',selectedControls.includes(id));localStorage.setItem('pony-preview-controls',JSON.stringify(selectedControls));target.querySelector('.quick-controls')?.replaceChildren();if(target.querySelector('.quick-controls'))target.querySelector('.quick-controls').innerHTML=quickControls();return}
  if(action==='close-sheet'){target.querySelector('.sheet-overlay')?.remove();return}
  if(action==='export'){toast(target,'示例原型暂无真实记录可导出。');return}
  if(action==='play'){toast(target,'回放交互预览：可拖动时间轴查看示意位置。');return}
  if(messages[action]){const [title,body]=messages[action];sheet(target,title,body,action==='settings'?`<div class="card menu-group">${['轮胎与车况','电池与动力','安全与驾驶','软件与更新','驾驶员与访问'].map(label=>menu('settings',label,'','vehicle-info')).join('')}</div>`:'')}
});
root.addEventListener('input',e=>{const target=e.target.closest('.phone');if(e.target.id==='charge-limit'){const value=e.target.value;target.querySelector('#limit-value').textContent=`${value}%`;target.querySelector('#charge-target').textContent=`${value}%`;target.querySelector('#charge-eta').textContent='—';toast(target,'仅预览充电上限；不会修改车辆设置。')}if(e.target.id==='replay-progress'){const n=12+Number(e.target.value);target.querySelector('#replay-time').textContent=`08:${String(n).padStart(2,'0')}`;const marker=target.querySelector('.detail-map circle[cx="232"]');if(marker)marker.setAttribute('opacity',.3+Number(e.target.value)/50)}});
